1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
MatchPulse Live turns seeded synthetic
match events into evidence-aware stories.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Every match fact comes from a
deterministic synthetic event stream.

3
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Passes, pressure, shots, saves, and goals
arrive through the event API.

4
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Match state updates immediately as the
synthetic scenario progresses.

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Duplicate events are acknowledged without
duplicating match state.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Out-of-order events are rejected to
preserve a consistent timeline.

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Fan mode makes the same evidence-backed
moment immediate.

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Analyst mode exposes inputs, derivation,
and confidence.

9
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Broadcaster mode compresses the insight
for live delivery.

10
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Language changes while the underlying
facts and evidence remain stable.

11
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:39,000
At full time, the validated state produces
a profile-specific recap.

12
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:48,000
Invalid optional output falls back to
safe, deterministic copy.

13
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:55,000
One match. Multiple audiences.
Traceable stories.
